OL,3,GNEWSABlack History Month outdated, says
OL,4,Atheatre producer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA south-east London theatre producer
OL,7,Fhas said Black History Month has become
OL,8,F"outdated", arguing black history
OL,9,Fshould be taught and celebrated
OL,10,Fthroughout the year.
OL,12,FMya Onwugbonu, 25, who grew up in New
OL,13,FCross, said the annual event risked
OL,14,Ftreating black history as a subject
OL,15,Fthat only needed attention for one
OL,16,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
