OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABlack History Month outdated, says
OL,4,Atheatre producer
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe told Politics London: "Obviously it
OL,7,Fwas begun as a way of celebrating us,
OL,8,Fbut it's now become a token of a time
OL,9,Fwhere we bring these people up just for
OL,10,Fa month and then it disappears for the
OL,11,Frest of the year."
OL,13,FOnwugbonu, who has produced shows
OL,14,Facross the capital, said she had
OL,15,Fexperienced a lack of respect in the
OL,16,Farts industry, which she described as
OL,17,Fpredominantly white in many of the
OL,18,Fspaces she has worked in.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
